    "shift": "shift_1"
  },
  "question": {
    "text": "A particle of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> moving with velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>&nbsp;collides with a stationary particle of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></math>. After collision, they stick together and continue to move together with velocity"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The law of conservation of momentum is given as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>u</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>v</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math></p><p>The given data is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>u</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mi>m</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></math></p><p>Using the conservation of momentum equation,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}